     "title": "Installed packages",
     "icon": "layers",
     "sub": "FOS Core is always on. This list is the mockup of the FOS module registry (fos_modules).",
     "html": "<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Package</th><th>Needs</th><th>Data</th><th>On</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr data-pkg-row=\"core\"><td><b>FOS Core</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Access control (users, roles, permissions), settings, products and services, custom fields, media, module registry, audit log, search</div></td><td>-</td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for FOS Core\" onchange=\"pkgMode('core',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled onchange=\"pkgToggle('core',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn FOS Core on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"ccc\"><td><b>Contact Control Center</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Contacts, directory, profiles, assets, settings lists</div></td><td>core</td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Contact Control Center\" onchange=\"pkgMode('ccc',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('ccc',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Contact Control Center on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"documents\"><td><b>Documents</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Uploads, review, expiry, per-section slots, document centre</div></td><td>core, ccc</td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Documents\" onchange=\"pkgMode('documents',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('documents',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Documents on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"collaboration\"><td><b>Collaboration</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Inbox, direct messages, email, WhatsApp, announcements, meetings, tasks, surveys, tickets</div></td><td>core, ccc<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">works with: documents</div></td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Collaboration\" onchange=\"pkgMode('collaboration',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('collaboration',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Collaboration on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"training\"><td><b>Training and Competency</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Courses, tests, certificates, competency matrix, expiry</div></td><td>core, ccc<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">works with: documents, collaboration</div></td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Training and Competency\" onchange=\"pkgMode('training',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\">Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\" selected>App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('training',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Training and Competency on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"insights\"><td><b>Insights (KPIs, scorecards, reports)</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">KPI definitions and targets, scorecards, dashboards, reports, schedules, exports, BI</div></td><td>core</td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Insights (KPIs, scorecards, reports)\" onchange=\"pkgMode('insights',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('insights',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Insights (KPIs, scorecards, reports) on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"commerce\"><td><b>Commerce</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Quotations, RFQs, purchase orders, receiving, invoices, expenses, payments, contracts, templates, SLAs, signatures</div></td><td>core, ccc, documents<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">works with: insights</div></td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Commerce\" onchange=\"pkgMode('commerce',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\">Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\" selected>Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('commerce',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Commerce on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"risk\"><td><b>Risk and Compliance</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Audits, findings, CAPA, risk register, inspections, ESG</div></td><td>core, ccc, documents<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">works with: insights, training</div></td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Risk and Compliance\" onchange=\"pkgMode('risk',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\">Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\" selected>App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('risk',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Risk and Compliance on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"automation\"><td><b>Automation and Platform</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Workflow rules, approval chains, integrations, AI copilot, form builder</div></td><td>core</td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Automation and Platform\" onchange=\"pkgMode('automation',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('automation',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Automation and Platform on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"vendoros\"><td><b>VendorOS Core</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Vendor lifecycle: directory, registration, approval, passport, assessment</div></td><td>core, ccc, documents, collaboration<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">works with: commerce, training, risk, contracts, insights</div></td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for VendorOS Core\" onchange=\"pkgMode('vendoros',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\">Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\" selected>Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('vendoros',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn VendorOS Core on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr><tr data-pkg-row=\"vendorportal\"><td><b>Vendor Portal</b><div class=\"cc-key\" style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">Vendor-facing home, company, documents, orders, invoices, training, messages, notifications</div></td><td>vendoros, collaboration<div style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)\">works with: commerce, training</div></td><td><select aria-label=\"Data mode for Vendor Portal\" onchange=\"pkgMode('vendorportal',this.value)\" style=\"padding:6px 8px;border:1.5px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface-2)\"><option value=\"fos\" selected>Use FOS tables</option><option value=\"own\">App's own tables</option><option value=\"hybrid\">Choose per port</option></select></td><td><label class=\"pkg-sw\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked onchange=\"pkgToggle('vendorportal',this.checked)\" aria-label=\"Turn Vendor Portal on or off\"><span></span></label></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p id=\"pkgMsg\" style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px\">Turning a package off hides its menu entries and tabs. Its data stays. A package that others need cannot be turned off until they are.</p>"
    }
   ]
